3. Use a Content Delivery Network (CDN):
A CDN can help improve the loading speed of your website by caching your content on servers located closer to your users. This reduces the amount of time it takes for your content to travel from your server to your users' devices.
```javascript
const cdnUrl = 'https://cdn.example.com';
